sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Visitor
    participant B as Browser
    participant H as Static Host
    V->>B: Open website URL
    B->>H: Request HTML document
    H-->>B: Return docs/index.html
    B->>H: Request docs/style.css and referenced assets
    H-->>B: Return static assets
    B->>B: Parse, style and render page
    B->>B: Execute browser JavaScript when invoked
    B-->>V: Display interactive page
